; Dates in the posting comments of a periodic rule. A date without a year takes the year of the Y directive
; before it, or else the current year (here only 02-29 would depend on it).
Y 2024
~ monthly
    ; date:garbage on a comment line before the first posting is not read
    a  1 EUR  ; date:02-29
    a  1 EUR  ; [02-29]
    a  1 EUR  ; date2:02-29
    a  1 EUR  ; [01-01=02-29]
    a  1 EUR  ; date:2026-01-02 date:02-03

Y 2026
~ monthly
    a  1 EUR  ; date:02-03
    a  1 EUR  ; [02-03]
